        "Title": "The Last Continent",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\"If you are unfamiliar with Pratchett\u2019s unique blend of philosophical badinage interspersed with slapstick, you are on the threshold of a mind-expanding opportunity.\u201d \u2014<em>Financial Times</em></strong></p><p><strong>Chaos ensues when Discworld\u2019s deliciously hapless wizard Rincewind goes walking about in the Down Under in this wonderfully witty satire from legendary internationally bestselling author Sir Terry Pratchett.</strong></p><p>There\u2019s big trouble at the Unseen University,...",
