        "Title": "Mort",
        "Description": "<p><strong><em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Terry Pratchett makes Death a central character in <em>Mort</em>, a clever and fabulous satirical fantasy and installment in the Discworld series, where a cheerfully hapless young man discovers that work can kill your love life when your boss\u2014and your girlfriend\u2019s dad\u2014is the Grim Reaper.</strong></p><p>Death comes to us all. When he came to Mort, he offered him a job. In this beloved work of fantasy comedy, the Grim Reaper is a black-robe...",
