        "EntitlementId": "81b932b8-ef50-4f98-87b7-20c0dbb0de9e",
        "Title": "Interesting Times",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cDiscworld is more complicated and satisfactory than Oz . . . has the energy of <em>The Hitchhiker\u2019s Guide to the Galaxy</em> and the inventiveness of <em>Alice in Wonderland . . .</em> brilliant.\u201d \u2014A. S. Byatt</strong></p><p><strong>When war, magic, politics, and one deliciously inept wizard collide, zany mayhem ensues in this delightful satire in Sir Terry Pratchett\u2019s internationally bestselling Discworld series.</strong></p><p>To the fine denizens of Discworld, the phrase \u201cMay...",
