        "Title": "The Wee Free Men",
        "Description": "<p><strong>ALA Best Fiction for Young Adults * ALA Notable Children's Book * Horn Book Fanfare Book * Kirkus Reviews Editor\u2019s Choice * SLJ Best Book of the Year</strong></p><p>By the beloved and bestselling grandmaster of fantasy, Sir Terry Pratchett, this is the first in a series of Discworld novels starring the young witch Tiffany Aching.</p><p>A nightmarish danger threatens from the other side of reality. . . .</p><p>Armed with only a frying pan and her common sense, young witch-to-be T...",
