        "Title": "Moving Pictures",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cCracking dialogue, compelling illogic and unchained whimsy.\u201d\u2014<em>Sunday Times</em></strong></p><p><strong>Movie mania sweeps across the Discworld creating disaster in its wake in this delightful take on Tinseltown and the lure of glamour, fame, close-ups, and big dreams from acclaimed <em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Sir Terry Pratchett.</strong></p><p>A new phenomenon is taking over the Discworld: moving pictures. The alchemists of Ankh-Morpork have discovered how to ...",
