        "Title": "Again, Dangerous Visions",
        "Description": "<p><strong>A follow-up to the original groundbreaking collection, <em>Again, Dangerous Visions</em> features forty-six short stories from giants of the science fiction genre.</strong></p><p>Grand Master of the Science Fiction Writers of America and winner of countless awards\u2014including the Hugo, Nebula, Edgar Allan Poe, and Bram Stoker\u2014Harlan Ellison proved once more that he was both unpredictable and irrepressible in this second collection of innovative science fiction. <em>Again, Dangerous ...",
