        "Title": "Pyramids",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cThe best kind of parody \u2013 funny and smart and still a good story.\u201d\u2014<em>Mail on Sunday</em></strong></p><p><strong>The syllabus at the Assassins\u2019 Guild didn\u2019t cover running a desert kingdom . . . and a newly deified teenage pharaoh is about to find out just what it means to be a god in this hilarious Discworld novel from beloved <em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Sir Terry Pratchett.</strong></p><p>Young Prince Teppic, heir to the throne of Djelibeybi, needs some schoolin...",
