        "Title": "Hogfather",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cPratchett\u2019s writing is a constant delight. No one mixes the fantastical and mundane to better comic effect or offers sharper insights into the absurdities of human endeavour.\u201d\u2014<em>Daily Mail</em></strong></p><p><strong>When the guy in the red suit goes missing the night before the Discworld\u2019s favorite holiday, it falls on Death to take up the sleigh reigns in this wonderfully irreverent holiday fantasy from <em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Terry Pratchett.</strong></p>...",
