        "Title": "Maskerade",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\"A master storyteller.\"</strong> \u2014 <strong>A. S. Byatt</strong></p><p><strong>The nineteenth installment in Sir Terry Pratchett's beloved Discworld series \u2014 which has sold more than 23 million copies worldwide.</strong></p><p><em>There\u2019s a kind of magic in masks. Masks conceal one face, but they reveal another. The one that only comes out in darkness . . .</em></p><p>The Ghost in the bone-white mask who haunts the Ankh-Morpork Opera House was always considered a benign presence\u2014...",
