        "EntitlementId": "47530555-b1ce-4946-8da2-673c6ba2de8f",
        "Title": "Monstrous Regiment",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cWickedly satirical . . . nothing short of brilliant.\u201d\u2014<em>Publishers Weekly</em> (starred review)</strong></p><p><strong><em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Sir Terry Pratchett explores the inanity of war, sexual politics, and why the best man for the job is often a woman in this acerbically funny and poignant Discworld novel.</strong></p><p>In the small country of Borogravia, there are strict rules citizens must follow. Women belong in the kitchen\u2014not in offices, pubs, n...",
