        "Title": "The Only Woman in the Room",
        "Description": "<p><strong>THE <em>NEW YORK TIMES</em> BESTSELLER</strong></p><p>THE <strong><em>USA TODAY</em> BESTSELLER</strong></p><p><strong>Bestselling author Marie Benedict reveals the story of a brilliant woman scientist only remembered for her beauty.</strong></p><p>Her beauty almost certainly saved her from the rising Nazi party and led to marriage with an Austrian arms dealer. Underestimated in everything else, she overheard the Third Reich's plans while at her husband's side and understood mor...",
