        "Title": "Thud!",
        "Description": "<p>\u201cStart with Douglas Adams\u2019s comic science fiction (<em>A Hitchhiker\u2019s Guide to the Galaxy</em>) and J.R.R. Tolkien\u2019s alternative worlds, mix in James Ellroy\u2019s gritty realism and Jonathan Swift\u2019s unflinching satire and, if you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll get something like Terry Pratchett\u2019s <em>Thud</em>!\u201d \u2014<em>Wall Street Journal</em></p><p>City Watch Commander Sam Vimes must solve the murder of a prominent dwarf or watch as Discworld is plunged into a bloody civil war in Terry Pratchett\u2019s brilliant...",
