        "Title": "The Golem and the Jinni",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cAn intoxicating fusion of fantasy and historical fiction. . . . Wecker\u2019s storytelling skills dazzle.\" \u2014Entertainment Weekly</strong></p><p><strong>A marvelous and absorbing debut historical fantasy novel about a chance meeting between two supernatural creatures in turn-of-the-century immigrant New York.</strong></p><p>Chava is a golem, a creature made of clay by a disgraced rabbi knowledgeable in the ways of dark Kabbalistic magic. She serves as the wife to a Polish merchant who...",
