        "Title": "A Wizard of Earthsea",
        "Description": "<p>The first novel of Ursula K. Le Guin's must-read Books of Earthsea.</p><p>Ged was the greatest sorcerer in Earthsea, but in his youth he was the reckless Sparrowhawk. In his hunger for power and knowledge at the renowned school for wizards, he tampered with long-held secrets and loosed a terrible shadow upon the world.</p><p>This is the tumultuous tale of his testing, a classic fantasy adventure where he mastered the mighty words of power, tamed an ancient dragon, and crossed death's thr...",
