        "EntitlementId": "1d506d8a-1f5e-42d3-a3b2-44661aa452b5",
        "Title": "The Truth",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\"Pratchett's <em>The Truth</em> will set you free\u2014and laughing. . . . If 'Dr. Who' had been conceived, written and performed by Monty Python's Flying Circus, the result might be something like Discworld . . . . [<em>The Truth</em>] sets its sights on an enduring institution, the news media, and skewers it.\" \u2014 CNN</strong></p><p><strong>Ankh-Morpork gets its first newspaper, unleashing a war of words and a battle for the truth in this in this funny, wise, and prescient novel in Sir...",
