        "Title": "Equal Rites",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cUnadulterated fun. . . witty, frequently hilarious.\u201d\u2014<em>San Francisco Chronicle</em></strong></p><p><strong>Chaos and hilarity ensue when a young woman becomes the first female wizard, upending the Discworld in this bitingly funny tale from internationally bestselling author Sir Terry Pratchett.</strong></p><p>A little knowledge is a dangerous thing, but it\u2019s not half so bad as a lot of ignorance.</p><p>Everyone knows there\u2019s no such thing as a female wizard. So when a dying w...",
