        "Title": "The Story of the Jews,",
        "Description": "<p><strong>In this magnificently illustrated cultural history\u2014the tie-in to the PBS and BBC series <em>The Story of the Jews</em>\u2014Simon Schama details the story of the Jewish experience, from their beginnings as an ancient tribal people to the opening of the New World in 1492.</strong></p><p>It is a story like no other: an epic of endurance against destruction, of creativity in oppression, joy amidst grief, the affirmation of life against the steepest of odds.</p><p>This epic of world histo...",
