        "EntitlementId": "23291939-9f81-44f3-810f-a92852d322f5",
        "Title": "The Light Fantastic",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cHumorously entertaining. . . subtly thought-provoking. . . . Pratchett\u2019s Discworld books are filled with humor and with magic, but they're rooted in\u2014of all things\u2014real life and cold, hard reason.\u201d\u2014<em>Chicago Tribune</em></strong></p><p><strong>Bumbling wizard Rincewind and hapless tourist Twoflower have survived a host of misadventures on their epic journey . . . only to face annihilation as a red star hurtles towards the Discworld in this gloriously funny second installment in ...",
