        "Title": "Feet of Clay",
        "Description": "<p><strong>\u201cThis is fantasy served with a twist of Monty Python, parody that works by never taking itself too seriously.\u201d \u2014<em>Publishers Weekly</em></strong></p><p><strong>Murder! Mahem! Bacon sandwiches! People are dying suspiciously in Ankh-Morpork, and Sam Vimes of the City Watch will find the truth. Another brilliant and hilarious Discworld adventure\u2014a classic of humorous fantasy\u2014from beloved <em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Terry Pratchett</strong></p><p>For Commander Sam Vi...",
